  "Metal Burst": {"power":0,"acc":100,"cat":"Physical","type":"Steel","pp":10,"priority":0,"target":"scripted","flags":{"protect":1,"mirror":1,"metronome":1,"failmefirst":1},"desc":"Deals damage to the last opposing Pokemon to hit the user with a physical or special attack this turn equal to 1.5 times the HP lost by the user from that attack, rounded down. If the user did not lose HP from that attack, this move deals damage with a power of 1 instead. If that opposing Pokemon's position is no longer in use, the damage is done to a random opposing Pokemon in range. Only the last hit of a multi-hit attack is counted. Fails if the user was not hit by an opposing Pokemon's physical or special attack this turn.","shortDesc":"If hit by an attack, returns 1.5x damage."},
