// Shadow moves, by hand: Pokémon XD's eighteen (Colosseum's one, Shadow Rush, as XD has it: 55 power), from Serebii's
// table and Bulbapedia's physical and special. Only Shadow Pokémon know them. They're of the Shadow type: super
// effective on any Pokémon that isn't a Shadow Pokémon and not very effective on one that is, whatever its types,
// and nothing has the Shadow type, so no Pokémon gets STAB from them. They have no PP to run out of (`shadow`: the
// engine doesn't count it), and none of them hurts its user (this game's own: Shadow Rush's and Shadow End's recoil
// are left out). Shadow Half, Sky, Hold and Shed are in data/battle-moves.js.
